Cumbria LRF - Fenella - SITREP 2
Time of report: 13/01/2026 1900

1. SITUATION
Incident status: Major incident declared. Response phase.
River levels on the Derwent and Greta remain high.

2. SITES AND ROUTES
- Keswick School: operating as a rest centre
- A591 near Thirlmere: remains closed (flooding)

3. AGENCIES RESPONDING
NH, Environment Agency, Cumbria Police, Electricity NW, NCIC Trust

4. NEXT MEETING
SCG at 1800. Dial-in details as previously circulated.

